Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.71,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.35,0:00:03.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most borrowers meet their liquidation line
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.19,0:00:04.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the worst possible day.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.95,0:00:07.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,The day the market finds it for them.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.46,0:00:09.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,MintAnchor lets you find it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.71,0:00:30.28,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.06,0:00:12.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Enter any Mezo address.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,The X-Ray reads the live trove.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.28,0:00:17.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,Straight from the chain itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,Over seven thousand bitcoin of collateral.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.99,0:00:24.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nearly one point four million MUSD of debt.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.36,0:00:26.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,And a liquidation price
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,of two hundred fifteen dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:48.56,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,Or build your own position.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.87,0:00:36.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two bitcoin against fifty thousand MUSD.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.20,0:00:38.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now drag the price down.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,Watch the band fall with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.52,0:00:43.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,Safe. Then watch. Then danger.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.01,0:00:46.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,Closing on the one hundred ten percent line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:01:09.82,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.91,0:00:51.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,Looping multiplies everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.47,0:00:54.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,The gains and the risk together.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.19,0:00:57.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four loops at fifty percent each.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Leverage over five times.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.13,0:01:01.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Liquidation just twelve percent
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.78,0:01:03.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,below the live price.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,One bad day ends it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.27,0:01:08.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rehearsed here, before any real loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:29.86,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.17,0:01:12.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,A check you cannot find again
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.43,0:01:13.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,is just a rumour.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,So save it on chain.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.32,0:01:17.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,The ratio. The liquidation price.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,The band and the label.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.69,0:01:22.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Written to the MintAnchor registry
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.34,0:01:23.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,on Mezo testnet.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.59,0:01:25.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Signed by the demo wallet.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,And labelled as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:41.85,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.21,0:01:32.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every result becomes a card.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.44,0:01:33.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ready to share.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,The position. The drop. The verdict.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.50,0:01:38.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your risk, in one picture,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.57,0:01:40.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,watermark and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:58.52,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.20,0:01:43.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,MintAnchor.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.20,0:01:45.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Stress-test your MUSD position
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.92,0:01:48.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,before the market does.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.01,0:01:51.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Built for the Mezo Buildathon, Wave Two.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.64,0:01:54.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Live on testnet. No real funds.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.45,0:01:56.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,And not financial advice.
